  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Applying&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> property in <math><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo></math> and adding, we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></msubsup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi>B</mi></math></p>",
